{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00148","headline":"送玄同真人李抱朴谒灊山仙祠 · 明皇帝","name":"送玄同真人李抱朴谒灊山仙祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城阙天中近，蓬瀛海上遥。\n归期千载鹤，春至一来朝。\n采药逢三秀，餐霞卧九霄。\n参同如有旨，金鼎待君烧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"明皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}